  "summary": "The product ships multiple surfaces: a desktop app, a single `superset` CLI binary, a TypeScript SDK (@superset_sh/sdk), and an MCP server that lets agents create and manage workspaces. Superset runs CLI-based coding agents in parallel, each isolated in its own git worktree with its own branch, terminal, and environment.",
